bry='[Brynjolfsson, Chandar e Chen (2025)](https://digitaleconomy.stanford.edu/publication/canaries-in-the-coal-mine-six-facts-about-the-recent-employment-effects-of-artificial-intelligence/)'
hos='[Hosseini Maasoum e Lichtinger (2026)](https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.5425555)'
hum='[Humlum e Vestergaard (2026)](https://doi.org/10.3386/w33777)'
uk='[Klein Teeselink (2025)](https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.5516798)'
